                <mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;Lives in the kit data dir, not in any repo.&lt;/b&gt; Survives every install and uninstall, so you fill it in once. Holds what never varies between your repos — org name, repo prefix, team, workspace hosts, cluster policy ids, CI runner." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5A6672;fontFamily=Helvetica;" parent="c3" vertex="1">
