                <mxCell id="c23" value="REPO TYPES  (--type)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;fillColor=#E9F0F7;strokeColor=#7FA8C9;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=16;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#1F3A52;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;container=1;collapsible=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="650" width="700" height="200" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;b&gt;api&lt;/b&gt; — FastAPI Databricks App. Ships the service spine: core/ · routers/ · services/ · repositories/ · schema/&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;etl&lt;/b&gt; — Lakeflow declarative pipeline, 4 tasks&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;job&lt;/b&gt; — scheduled Databricks Job&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;fe&lt;/b&gt; — React Databricks App. Ships the shell: app/ (feature registry) · features/ · shared/ · server.mjs&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;genie&lt;/b&gt; — Genie space, deployed by script&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;agent&lt;/b&gt; — Multi-Agent Supervisor, instructions + tool list&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Only api and job receive the service-structure standard — the others have no request boundary. fe is the only non-Python repo: React standards, a Node .gitignore, and a .bundleignore that KEEPS dist/." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#5A6672;fontFamily=Helvetica;" parent="c23" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="24" y="40" width="652" height="150" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c25" value="WHERE IT LANDS" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;fillColor=#EEF0F2;strokeColor=#9AA5AF;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=16;spacingTop=6;fontColor=#333333;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;container=1;collapsible=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="780" y="650" width="420" height="200" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c26" value="&lt;b&gt;--output-dir&lt;/b&gt;, never inside the install target. A generated repo and the installed kit never share a directory.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Folder name is &lt;b&gt;&amp;lt;prefix&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;slug&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;type&amp;gt;&lt;/b&gt;, each part added only if the slug does not already say it:&lt;br&gt;payments + api → ai-payments-api&lt;br&gt;api-gateway + api → ai-api-gateway&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;repo_prefix is a profile value; --repo-name overrides the whole name." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#5A6672;fontFamily=Helvetica;" parent="c25" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="24" y="40" width="372" height="150" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
